      <choices>
        <choice value="super"/>
        <choice value="capslock"/>
      </choices>
      <default>'super'</default>
      <summary>Super key</summary>
      <description>The key for the &lt;Super&gt; modifier of the shortcuts. The shortcuts are always stored with &lt;Super&gt;. "super": the Super key. "capslock": Caps Lock, which needs the XKB option rektangel:caps_hyper. Rektangel then registers the shortcuts with &lt;Mod3&gt;.</description>
